    <diagram id="anti-dupe" name="Anti-dupe Rules">
        <mxGraphModel dx="920" dy="769" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1200" pageHeight="800" background="#ffffff" math="0" shadow="0">
            <root>
                <mxCell id="0"/>
                <mxCell id="1" parent="0"/>
                <mxCell id="t" value="&lt;b&gt;Anti-duplication — PR blockers&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontSize=18;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="350" y="20" width="400" height="30" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="r" value="1. No per-agent Protocol copies — use platform_ctl/ports&#10;2. One Cliq render path — freeze infra relay.py formatter fork&#10;3. No vendor types in workflows — opaque refs only&#10;4. No prompt strings in Python — PromptRegistry keys&#10;5. Shared HTTP/OTel via agent-common — ban forks&#10;6. FailoverDocStore wrapper — not forked MinIO/GDrive logic&#10;7. Jira = new TicketStore adapter — not OP fork&#10;8. Multi-port sequences → platform_ctl/services/&#10;9. Feature flags at composition root only&#10;10. Cards via Notifier.send_card — not raw POST in handler" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;spacingLeft=16;spacingTop=8;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E11D48;fontColor=#0F172A;fontSize=13;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="80" y="70" width="1000" height="320" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
            </root>
        </mxGraphModel>
    </diagram>
